            "attrs": {
              "style": "p"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "It is",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "PRO.20.14",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "PRO.20.14"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " naught, ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PRO.20.14",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PRO.20.14"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "it is",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "PRO.20.14",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "PRO.20.14"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " naught, saith the buyer: but when he is gone his way, then he boasteth. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PRO.20.14",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PRO.20.14"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "There is gold, and a multitude of rubies: but the lips of knowledge ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PRO.20.15",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PRO.20.15"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "are",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "PRO.20.15",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "PRO.20.15"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " a precious jewel. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PRO.20.15",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PRO.20.15"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Take his garment that is surety ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PRO.20.16",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PRO.20.16"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "for",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "PRO.20.16",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "PRO.20.16"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " a stranger: and take a pledge of him for a strange woman. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PRO.20.16",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PRO.20.16"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "verseCount": 3,
